    <!-- Help and about -->
    <string name="section_about">Help &amp; about</string>
    <string name="faq_title">Common questions</string>
    <string name="faq_taps_q">Why doesn\'t tapping the wallpaper open my calendar?</string>
    <string name="faq_taps_a">Android passes home-screen taps to a wallpaper only if your launcher supports it, and never on the lock screen. Widgets always work: see Widgets &amp; shortcuts.</string>
    <string name="faq_lock_q">The lock-screen clock or notifications cover my agenda.</string>
    <string name="faq_lock_a">Open Lock screen &amp; privacy and raise \"Keep clear at the top\" or \"Keep clear at the bottom\". The preview there shows the lock screen.</string>
    <string name="faq_events_q">My events are missing.</string>
    <string name="faq_events_a">Check that calendar access is allowed and that the calendar is selected in Calendars &amp; tasks. Events come from calendars synced to this phone, so turn on syncing for that account in your calendar app.</string>
    <string name="faq_battery_q">Does it drain the battery?</string>
    <string name="faq_battery_a">No timers, no animation and no background service: it redraws only when something changes. Battery saver mode goes further and sets a still image.</string>
    <string name="faq_privacy_q">Who can see my agenda?</string>
    <string name="faq_privacy_a">Anyone who sees your lock screen. Turn on \"Hide titles: When locked\" to show only counts there. Nothing leaves your phone: no account, no ads, no tracking.</string>
    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_body">Free and open source (Apache 2.0). Made to stay calm, light and private.</string>
